<title>USA: USDA reports 105,000 tonnes soybeans to unknown.</title>
<headline>USDA reports 105,000 tonnes soybeans to unknown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private exporters reported to the Agriculture Department export sales of 105,000 tonnes of soybeans for delivery to unknown destinations during the 1996/97 marketing year, USDA said Friday.</p>
<p>The marketing year for soybeans began Sept 1.</p>
